{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Through Blood and Dragons: Dragon Wars</i> is a heart pounding, single-player, on-rails dragon shooter set in the epic fantasy world of R.M. Schultz's celebrated novels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique dual rider-dragon game play with thrilling 360\u00b0 combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dramatic single-player campaign with fully voiced cinematics and awe-inspiring graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance Curik and his dragons with tiers of magical and physical upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect eggs and medallions,  customize your appearance with beautiful or terrifying cosmetics, and unlock and ride ten different dragon breeds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for original TBaD 'Dragon Shanties' and breathtaking cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the spellbinding lore of TBaD, explore Cimeren, make allies, defend Belvenguard, and face the malevolent Dragon Queen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take evasive maneuvers - including death-defying barrel rolls - while shooting ballistae bolts at your enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soar over burning and icy kingdoms, through enchanted forests, and across deserts and seas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breathe fire, ice, acid, and many more dragon breaths on castle ballistae</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront harrowing bosses, including the  Dragon Queen and her terror-inducing shadow dragon, Shadowmar</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE LORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were not meant to ride dragons. Not until you were willing to bleed for them... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand new saga has awoken in the TBaD universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"